# ponytail: this folder holds the ArgonVault pepper secret for the krt store
# auth-service. NEVER commit anything in here. The pepper converts a DB-only
# breach into a two-point failure (DB + secrets) — but only if it stays secret.
#
# pepper.key    64 hex chars (32 bytes), generated via crypto.randomBytes(32)
#
# Rotate: drop a pepper2.key alongside, the loader HMACs with both during
# transition, then retire pepper.key once all hashes have rehashed on login.
*
!.gitignore
